(7289693, 1136121, 175719, '<td valign="top">Great composition. exposure is beautiful.  I think maybe back down a little bit on the processing,  the HDR looks great on the plate but takes away from the food  especially the meat.  It starts to become an illustration not a photograph.  Overall you did a great job,  in the top 10 of this Challenge.</td>', 'Great composition. exposure is beautiful.  I think maybe back down a little bit on the processing,  the HDR looks great on the plate but takes away from the food  especially the meat.  It starts to become an illustration not a photograph.  Overall you did a great job,  in the top 10 of this Challenge.', '2014-12-03 18:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289694, 1136536, 175719, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition I love  your use of depth of field. 10</td>', 'Beautiful composition I love  your use of depth of field. 10', '2014-12-03 18:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289695, 1136417, 175719, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely fantastic.  So great way to think out-of-the-box I like the interaction between the people and you meet the challenge beautifully done.</td>', 'This is absolutely fantastic.  So great way to think out-of-the-box I like the interaction between the people and you meet the challenge beautifully done.', '2014-12-03 18:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289931, 1136534, 68504, '<td valign="top">love this. so true.</td>', 'love this. so true.', '2014-12-04 20:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
