(7291240, 1136121, 135744, '<td valign="top">This looks well photographed. To be honest I am not sure what the food item is on the plate so look forward to finding out after the challenge ends.</td>', 'This looks well photographed. To be honest I am not sure what the food item is on the plate so look forward to finding out after the challenge ends.', '2014-12-08 10:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291242, 1136551, 135744, '<td valign="top">I like the general feel and almost symmetrical aspect of the photo. Not that keen on the vignette/fog type element. If I was picky I would say the napkins look a bit messy and the salt and pepper pots could have been aligned better but that is assuming you were trying to make it look picture perfect.</td>', 'I like the general feel and almost symmetrical aspect of the photo. Not that keen on the vignette/fog type element. If I was picky I would say the napkins look a bit messy and the salt and pepper pots could have been aligned better but that is assuming you were trying to make it look picture perfect.', '2014-12-08 10:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291243, 1136157, 135744, '<td valign="top">Does make my mouth water but don''t find the photo too exciting.</td>', 'Does make my mouth water but don''t find the photo too exciting.', '2014-12-08 10:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291244, 1136510, 135744, '<td valign="top">Just looks like a snap shot. Lots of distracting elements in the background. Food looks quite tasty though:)</td>', 'Just looks like a snap shot. Lots of distracting elements in the background. Food looks quite tasty though:)', '2014-12-08 10:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291245, 1136531, 135744, '<td valign="top">Wow, not only is this a very nicely taken photo, the subject matter is to die for. They look mighty tasty chips (UK terminology) and I would love a bowl of those right now. Very well taken photo - they look good enough to eat!</td>', 'Wow, not only is this a very nicely taken photo, the subject matter is to die for. They look mighty tasty chips (UK terminology) and I would love a bowl of those right now. Very well taken photo - they look good enough to eat!', '2014-12-08 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291246, 1136339, 135744, '<td valign="top">Nothint really fully in focus here and the composition could be better.</td>', 'Nothint really fully in focus here and the composition could be better.', '2014-12-08 10:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291247, 1136550, 135744, '<td valign="top">I think this would be better if the "cake" was totally in focus byt the front edge is out of focus.</td>', 'I think this would be better if the "cake" was totally in focus byt the front edge is out of focus.', '2014-12-08 10:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291248, 1136221, 135744, '<td valign="top">No idea what I am looking at. Looks like wheel and a chicken stuffed into a recycle bin. I don''t find it very interesting.</td>', 'No idea what I am looking at. Looks like wheel and a chicken stuffed into a recycle bin. I don''t find it very interesting.', '2014-12-08 10:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291249, 1136188, 135744, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the simple ideas work best. Nice and colouful but I was there was more definition between the individual corn elements.</td>', 'Sometimes the simple ideas work best. Nice and colouful but I was there was more definition between the individual corn elements.', '2014-12-08 10:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291254, 1136542, 135744, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit photograph. I don''t mind the knife and glass getting the chop in the crop but would have preferred not to have the large food item in the bottom central area chopped off. The focus seems a little off too - the food bowl on the left with the snail looks in good focus but some other bowls of food are not in such great focus.</td>', 'Nicely lit photograph. I don''t mind the knife and glass getting the chop in the crop but would have preferred not to have the large food item in the bottom central area chopped off. The focus seems a little off too - the food bowl on the left with the snail looks in good focus but some other bowls of food are not in such great focus.', '2014-12-08 10:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291257, 1136534, 135744, '<td valign="top">Would  have thought the turkey should have been in focus but perhaps your intention was to have the man in focus. I enjoyed having a look around your kitchen.</td>', 'Would  have thought the turkey should have been in focus but perhaps your intention was to have the man in focus. I enjoyed having a look around your kitchen.', '2014-12-08 10:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
